*~
s3cfg
\#*\#
#
# intermediate / generated fiiles
#
#
# A script I use all over the place hard coded to what I am currently
# reviewing must be ignored
vp
*.incl
*.errlog
*.stylelog
output.rtc
.claude/settings.local.json
# the leading '*' covers unit1's unprefixed lessons-pdfs/ as well as
# unit2+'s uN-prefixed u2lessons-pdfs/, u3lessons-pdfs/, etc. in one line
**/*lessons-pdfs/*.pdf
# fcreview01/fcexam02 (the full-course documents) use an fc- prefix
# instead of a uN- prefix, so they don't match the *lessons-pdfs/
# *lessons-media/ patterns above -- covered explicitly here instead.
fc-pdfs/*.pdf
fc-pdfs/*.errlog
fc-pdfs/*.stylelog
fc-pdfs/output.rtc
dist/
dist/*
__pycache__/
__pycache__/*
build/
build/*
# images generated from lessons-gp scripts so ignore them (lessons-media is
# unit1's real output dir, u2lessons-media/ etc. for unit2+; images is a
# local symlink alias to whichever one is active, see below). Same '*'
# prefix trick as lessons-pdfs above.
**/*lessons-media/*.png
fc-media/*.png
# local rendering convenience symlink, recreated per work session
# (points at whichever unit's real *lessons-media dir you're working on),
# never committed. No trailing slash: a trailing-slash pattern only
# matches real directories, not symlinks, and images is always a symlink.
/images

